if (ateFood) {
    score++;
}
```

The full movement order should be:

1. Apply a queued direction, if one exists.
2. Calculate the new head.
3. Check whether the new head is on the food.
4. Add the head.
5. Remove the tail only if food was not eaten.
6. If food was eaten, increase the score and create new food.
